{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24322","headline":"闲居春尽 · 白居易","name":"闲居春尽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲泊池舟静掩扉，老身慵出客来稀。\n愁应暮雨留教住，春被残莺唤遣归。\n揭瓮偷尝新熟酒，开箱试着旧生衣。\n冬裘夏葛相催促，垂老光阴速似飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}